 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-10-04",
   "text": "Campus Accountability and Safety Act\n This bill addresses sexual harassment, sexual assault, and other violence and harassment on the campuses of institutions of higher education (IHEs). Among other provisions, the bill (1) requires additional information to be included in the annual campus security report provided to current and prospective students and employees, (2) requires each IHE to establish a campus security policy that meets certain requirements, and (3) authorizes grants to address these issues."
  }
 ],
